WEBVTT

01:35.900 --> 01:38.289
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.440 --> 01:41.330
[Episode 3]

01:48.920 --> 01:49.780
Zhao Zhenghao!

01:51.000 --> 01:52.039
If you lose,

01:52.680 --> 01:54.410
you must not pick on them again.

01:54.920 --> 01:56.050
But if you guys lose,

01:56.120 --> 01:58.120
you have to apologize to us
at the school gate.

01:58.120 --> 02:00.120
I'll have everyone in the school know

02:00.120 --> 02:01.720
who's the toughest guy here.

02:02.200 --> 02:02.800
Two on two.

02:03.200 --> 02:03.930
Let's begin.

02:14.400 --> 02:16.530
Why are they playing basketball here?

02:16.680 --> 02:19.740
I heard they fought over drinks
at the vending machine.

02:36.680 --> 02:37.480
I bought that!

02:38.180 --> 02:40.850
[Men's Room]

02:38.280 --> 02:39.590
That's not it. They bumped into each other

02:39.590 --> 02:42.720
in the washroom, quarreled,
and nearly got into a fight.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.120
Hey!

02:48.280 --> 02:49.540
I've had enough of you.

02:49.840 --> 02:52.240
Just because you have good grades
doesn't mean I dare not beat you.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.360
Zhao Zhenghao, the school rules say

02:53.360 --> 02:55.360
brawling can be a ground for expulsion.

02:55.360 --> 02:57.000
Since you're asking for trouble,

02:57.000 --> 02:58.000
then act like a man

02:58.079 --> 02:59.560
and have a fair fight with me.

02:59.560 --> 03:01.150
Sure. Let's do it in the P.E. class.

03:01.150 --> 03:01.950
It's settled.

03:02.280 --> 03:03.680
See you on the playground.

03:03.680 --> 03:05.000
Hope you won't chicken out.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.130
Or I'll despise you.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.430
Unlike some people,
I don't take advantage

03:09.590 --> 03:11.560
of those taking a bathroom break.

03:13.590 --> 03:15.590
Zhenghao, calm down.

03:17.930 --> 03:22.020
[Men's Room]

03:22.400 --> 03:24.800
What exactly are they up to?

03:40.800 --> 03:42.800
Zhao Zhenghao is amazing!

03:43.430 --> 03:45.000
Whose side are you on?

03:45.120 --> 03:47.180
I'm on Tong Xiaole's side, of course.

03:55.240 --> 03:57.570
I didn't touch him.
He just fell on his own!

03:59.079 --> 04:01.280
Sir, I think I have a fractured bone.

04:03.000 --> 04:03.800
Eyes front!

04:05.400 --> 04:06.530
As fellow students,

04:06.800 --> 04:08.400
you should be kind and supportive

04:08.400 --> 04:09.150
to each other.

04:09.150 --> 04:10.880
How could you fight each other?

04:12.430 --> 04:13.490
Here's what you do.

04:13.870 --> 04:14.930
Stand face to face,

04:15.000 --> 04:15.710
hold your hands,

04:15.710 --> 04:17.720
and name five of each other's strengths.

04:17.720 --> 04:18.579
Zhao Zhenghao,

04:18.950 --> 04:19.680
you go first.

04:20.360 --> 04:21.690
What are you staring at?

04:38.720 --> 04:39.920
You have good grades.

04:40.240 --> 04:41.040
So what?

04:42.480 --> 04:43.740
You're good-looking.

04:43.830 --> 04:44.600
So what?

04:45.600 --> 04:47.060
You play basketball well,

04:47.360 --> 04:48.600
but I'm still better.

04:50.800 --> 04:51.920
As for height...

04:53.000 --> 04:54.659
you're roughly as tall as I am.

04:55.720 --> 04:57.240
All the teachers like you.

04:59.159 --> 05:00.000
I'm done, Sir.

05:01.390 --> 05:02.250
It's your turn.

05:04.240 --> 05:04.920
Yes, Sir.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.720
Zhao Zhenghao...

05:08.560 --> 05:10.620
is fairly responsible and generous.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.720
He never bullies others

05:12.720 --> 05:14.250
or loses his temper easily.

05:15.040 --> 05:17.040
As the captain of the school orchestra,

05:17.040 --> 05:18.370
he's highly competent.

05:21.480 --> 05:22.880
Alright, that's enough.

05:23.920 --> 05:25.180
The floor is yours now.

05:32.920 --> 05:34.600
I suggest we take turns to name

05:34.680 --> 05:35.940
one strength at a time.

05:36.480 --> 05:37.000
Okay.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.920
You have beautiful eyes.

05:41.920 --> 05:44.050
Your nose is the best part of your face.

05:45.920 --> 05:48.240
Your hair is flowy, though thinning.

05:48.270 --> 05:49.390
Your ears look fine

05:49.600 --> 05:51.040
from the front,

05:51.040 --> 05:53.300
though they indicate you're a pushover.

05:55.240 --> 05:57.570
Why am I the first one to speak
at each turn?

05:59.920 --> 06:01.240
You have broad shoulders.

06:01.240 --> 06:02.600
Your eyes aren't pretty,

06:02.600 --> 06:03.920
but you have great eyesight.

06:03.920 --> 06:05.780
You're endowed with a deep voice,

06:06.000 --> 06:07.200
but it's unpleasant.

06:08.600 --> 06:10.160
You are friends with the top student.

06:10.160 --> 06:13.020
You play basketball well.
You can speak quite fast.

06:15.160 --> 06:16.160
There you go.

06:16.600 --> 06:17.130
Alright.

06:17.480 --> 06:18.540
You're dismissed.

06:18.600 --> 06:19.130
Go, boys.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.480
Zhao Zhenghao.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.600
If you ever bully them again,

06:30.600 --> 06:32.130
I'll treat you like this...

06:36.360 --> 06:38.920
Sir, Zhao Zhenghao just hit me!

06:39.600 --> 06:40.159
I'm in pain!

06:40.159 --> 06:41.020
Zhao Zhenghao!

06:43.159 --> 06:44.360
Did he really hit you?

06:44.920 --> 06:45.720
Did he?

06:45.830 --> 06:47.430
I need to go to the infirmary.

06:48.360 --> 06:49.620
On your best behavior!

07:00.900 --> 07:02.410
[Class 9, Grade 11]

07:02.560 --> 07:04.720
The results of the monthly exam are in.

07:05.360 --> 07:07.690
I'll give each of you
your test paper back.

07:07.920 --> 07:09.270
Look what you did wrong.

07:09.800 --> 07:12.270
You could've gotten points
by writing one more line in the answers,

07:12.270 --> 07:13.530
but you just wouldn't.

07:14.920 --> 07:15.380
Listen,

07:15.560 --> 07:17.920
it is still Tong Xiaole
who has the highest score.

07:17.060 --> 07:19.320
[Aoki High School Monthly Test
for Grade 11 Students]

07:18.160 --> 07:19.090
The lowest score

07:19.160 --> 07:19.920
is 48.

07:20.650 --> 07:21.960
[Name: Luo Ningzi] [Score: 138]

07:21.360 --> 07:23.240
As for who took it, I won't say.

07:23.720 --> 07:24.800
Just see for yourselves,

07:24.800 --> 07:26.800
as each of you will have your paper back.

07:26.800 --> 07:28.330
Take out your mistake logs.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.560
Write down the questions

07:30.600 --> 07:31.730
you answered wrong.

07:31.860 --> 07:34.180
[Aoki High School Monthly Test
for Grade 11 Students] [Score: 48]

07:32.040 --> 07:32.800
As I said before,

07:32.800 --> 07:34.510
good grades are within reach,

07:35.270 --> 07:36.750
as long as you put in

07:36.920 --> 07:38.720
some real effort.

07:44.600 --> 07:47.040
Why haven't they come back
from the infirmary?

07:47.040 --> 07:48.270
Are they in trouble?

07:57.920 --> 07:58.830
Tong Xiaole!

07:59.800 --> 08:00.750
Tong Xiaole!

08:05.600 --> 08:06.920
My goodness.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.480
Is it that serious?

08:09.480 --> 08:10.360
Are you okay?

08:10.800 --> 08:11.830
It's you, Yi Lan.

08:13.000 --> 08:14.270
I thought you were faking it.

08:14.270 --> 08:15.870
Little did I know it was real.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.680
Get up now.

08:20.240 --> 08:22.300
Isn't a self-study class in session?

08:22.360 --> 08:25.220
Are you sure
coming here won't affect your studies?

08:26.800 --> 08:27.720
Is your head hurting?

08:27.720 --> 08:28.120
Yes.

08:28.120 --> 08:29.360
What about other places?

08:29.360 --> 08:30.600
Are you hurt anywhere else?

08:30.600 --> 08:31.480
How about your legs?

08:31.480 --> 08:32.409
My legs are fine.

08:33.840 --> 08:34.720
Oh my god.

08:35.480 --> 08:37.340
Has this wound been disinfected?

08:37.480 --> 08:38.150
Not yet.

08:40.030 --> 08:42.030
The school nurse is on leave today,

08:42.030 --> 08:43.690
so it hasn't been attended to.

08:43.909 --> 08:44.600
Yi Lan,

08:45.360 --> 08:47.790
this wound is actually no big deal.

08:48.510 --> 08:51.570
It must be disinfected
to prevent infection, you know?

08:54.240 --> 08:55.000
I'm fine.

08:55.240 --> 08:56.200
Does it hurt?

08:58.440 --> 08:58.960
Yes, terribly.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.240
Just bear with it.

09:02.200 --> 09:03.080
How about...

09:03.840 --> 09:04.360
you

09:04.720 --> 09:06.520
blow on my wound to ease the pain?

09:09.720 --> 09:10.080
Okay.

09:10.360 --> 09:11.620
I think that will work.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.450
Are you feeling better?

09:33.720 --> 09:34.850
Y-Yes, much better.

09:35.750 --> 09:36.750
Let me put this on.

09:43.510 --> 09:45.360
How are you going to do homework then?

09:45.360 --> 09:46.620
Can you move this hand?

09:48.480 --> 09:49.280
Is it hurting?

09:55.120 --> 09:55.870
Luo Ningzi.

09:56.120 --> 09:56.720
Ning.

09:58.120 --> 09:58.960
Where is Chen Fan?

09:58.960 --> 09:59.960
Where is Chen Fan?

10:01.080 --> 10:02.480
I'm right here!

10:03.630 --> 10:05.750
I heard everything,

10:05.750 --> 10:09.000
including
"blow on my wound to ease the pain."

10:11.840 --> 10:13.570
God knows what has got into him.

10:15.360 --> 10:17.560
I won't wait for you after school today.

10:18.600 --> 10:20.930
Don't go so fast! Isn't your head hurting?

10:26.240 --> 10:27.600
Looks like you're fine.

10:27.960 --> 10:28.690
Are you okay?

10:28.960 --> 10:31.160
I'm in perfect condition. Don't worry.

10:31.750 --> 10:33.630
Zhao Zhenghao won't bother you anymore.

10:33.630 --> 10:35.360
Thanks for everything you did.

10:35.960 --> 10:36.960
Don't mention it.

10:37.000 --> 10:38.840
If Zhao Zhenghao ever troubles you again,

10:38.840 --> 10:39.360
I will...

10:39.360 --> 10:40.720
kick him away.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.170
I'm going back to study.

10:50.750 --> 10:51.440
Boss!

10:51.870 --> 10:52.600
Boss!

10:55.840 --> 10:56.480
My boss...

10:57.000 --> 10:58.120
Are you alright?

10:58.360 --> 10:59.560
What took you so long?

11:01.000 --> 11:04.360
I would've come earlier if the teacher
hadn't made me stay for papers.

11:04.360 --> 11:05.720
I'm sorry, Boss...

11:07.720 --> 11:10.240
G-Go back to your papers. Leave me alone.

11:10.510 --> 11:11.320
Boss,

11:11.840 --> 11:13.840
you're more important than papers.

11:17.120 --> 11:19.870
Chen Fan and Tong Xiaole
went way out of line.

11:20.480 --> 11:22.410
Shall we teach them a lesson again?

11:23.480 --> 11:25.210
Don't you see my leg's injured?

11:25.840 --> 11:27.600
If it worsens,
serious problems will occur.

11:27.600 --> 11:29.440
Yes. Your leg needs proper care.

11:30.600 --> 11:31.440
Let me rub it.

11:33.200 --> 11:34.000
Nice skills.

11:34.320 --> 11:35.120
Of course.

11:39.720 --> 11:40.650
Give me a second.

11:40.720 --> 11:43.590
It's quite a steep slope.

11:43.750 --> 11:45.080
Are you up for this?

11:45.080 --> 11:46.430
Yes, yes. I got it.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.720
Yi Lan, why not let me ride it instead?

11:59.720 --> 12:00.630
No, no, no.

12:00.630 --> 12:03.200
What if you fall and break your brain?

12:03.360 --> 12:05.510
That precious brain of yours
is for studying.

12:05.510 --> 12:07.840
Leave this manual labor to me.

12:23.320 --> 12:24.250
Anything wrong?

12:24.320 --> 12:25.720
I-I can walk home myself.

12:25.720 --> 12:26.720
But why?

12:27.360 --> 12:28.750
I can give you a ride!

12:31.000 --> 12:32.000
Sit down.

12:37.840 --> 12:39.480
I'll cook for you.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.510
There's no food in the fridge.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.750
It really is empty.

12:48.000 --> 12:48.800
But it's fine.

12:49.360 --> 12:50.760
I'll shop for groceries.

12:53.360 --> 12:54.160
I've got this.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.240
Yi Lan.

12:57.360 --> 12:58.080
Yi Lan!

12:58.320 --> 12:58.720
Why...

12:58.870 --> 13:00.320
why don't we go out to eat?

13:01.840 --> 13:02.840
These shrimps...

13:03.600 --> 13:05.510
really died a terrible death.

13:07.720 --> 13:10.200
It's true that they don't look good,

13:10.320 --> 13:12.720
but I'm sure they taste fine.

13:14.870 --> 13:15.360
Okay.

13:21.720 --> 13:23.850
Is this stir fried tomatoes with eggs?

13:24.510 --> 13:24.870
Yes.

13:25.200 --> 13:26.440
Just taste it.

13:26.720 --> 13:29.050
Are you sure
I won't end up in the hospital?

13:46.870 --> 13:47.960
It's actually good.

13:47.960 --> 13:48.360
Really?

13:48.360 --> 13:49.870
Ugly though it seems,

13:50.120 --> 13:50.650
it tastes

13:50.870 --> 13:51.750
unexpectedly good.

13:51.750 --> 13:52.360
Yeah.

13:52.600 --> 13:54.800
So you didn't taste it after cooking it?

13:55.080 --> 13:56.840
I stir fried it for a second time.

13:56.840 --> 13:58.300
Now it tastes even better.

14:01.870 --> 14:02.440
Yi Lan.

14:04.360 --> 14:05.490
I want some shrimps.

14:09.720 --> 14:12.780
But I don't think I can peel them
with this injured hand.

14:14.480 --> 14:16.680
You're well. Your mouth is not injured.

14:21.080 --> 14:21.840
Fine.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.290
Time to confess.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.120
Why are you suddenly being so nice to me?

14:28.120 --> 14:30.240
One who is unaccountably solicitous
must have evil intentions.

14:30.240 --> 14:31.000
What do you want?

14:31.000 --> 14:32.530
What could I possibly want?

14:32.550 --> 14:34.550
I saw you all by yourself with nobody

14:34.720 --> 14:36.180
attending to your injury.

14:36.720 --> 14:39.240
I felt the need to take care of you
since we're best friends.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.700
Isn't your best friend...

14:41.720 --> 14:42.750
Luo Ningzi?

14:43.120 --> 14:45.000
Luo Ningzi is a good friend of mine.

14:45.000 --> 14:46.240
You are my best friend.

14:46.240 --> 14:47.900
That can't be the same, right?

14:48.240 --> 14:50.360
It actually sounds... sincere.

14:51.120 --> 14:52.120
But I don't buy it.

14:52.360 --> 14:54.440
I was worried sick about you,

14:54.440 --> 14:56.080
so I visited you at the infirmary.

14:56.080 --> 14:58.240
How can you be so ungrateful?

15:01.200 --> 15:02.480
I just made you a feast.

15:04.860 --> 15:06.250
[Aoki High School Monthly Test
for Grade 11 Students] [Score: 48]

15:08.820 --> 15:09.420
[Aoki High School Monthly Test
for Grade 11 Students]

15:09.450 --> 15:12.080
This low score is a real shame.
Why bring my paper out?

15:12.080 --> 15:13.510
But I don't think it's a shame.

15:13.510 --> 15:14.840
On the contrary, I'm proud of it.

15:14.840 --> 15:15.790
You got 10 last time,

15:15.790 --> 15:17.590
and 48 this time. It's progress.

15:17.600 --> 15:19.120
Stop mocking me.

15:19.480 --> 15:21.480
Even the way Luo Ningzi looks at me
has changed.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.720
Finals are coming up soon.

15:22.720 --> 15:24.120
Could you please help me?

15:24.120 --> 15:27.240
You have a knack for taking exams, Xiaole.

15:27.480 --> 15:29.480
And I'm your best friend.

15:29.720 --> 15:31.780
Just help me pass the finals, please.

15:33.750 --> 15:34.720
Look at my eyes.

15:36.480 --> 15:37.600
You already did a great job.

15:37.600 --> 15:39.000
You were really close to passing.

15:39.000 --> 15:40.240
It was an achievement itself.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.630
Are you my best friend or not?

15:41.630 --> 15:43.320
Will you help me? Yes or no?

15:43.630 --> 15:45.120
Now, cancel these two out

15:45.200 --> 15:46.600
to get this equation.

15:46.750 --> 15:48.200
Alright, that's about it.

15:48.200 --> 15:50.800
Next, just recite the text
of Hongmen Banquet.

15:52.960 --> 15:55.530
♪ She left in spring ♪

15:56.460 --> 15:59.340
♪ Gone with her was cherry blossoms ♪

16:00.050 --> 16:02.470
♪ On the once youthful face ♪

16:03.660 --> 16:06.340
♪ There were tears amidst confusion ♪

16:07.220 --> 16:09.490
♪ She left in spring ♪

16:10.590 --> 16:13.170
♪ All was like a dream ♪

16:13.720 --> 16:15.240
That's enough studying.

16:13.940 --> 16:16.710
♪ Youth never lasts ♪

16:16.000 --> 16:17.120
Go to bed now.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.750
Sure, just after I finish this, Dad.

16:18.120 --> 16:20.650
♪ Just let her go ♪

16:21.480 --> 16:22.080
Stop it now.

16:21.820 --> 16:24.010
♪ The paper plane that was once set free ♪

16:22.750 --> 16:23.480
Go to sleep.

16:24.170 --> 16:27.570
♪ Will find its way back
to the old desk and chair at school ♪

16:24.200 --> 16:25.840
Time for a mock exam.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.780
Pass the papers to those behind you.

16:27.780 --> 16:30.600
♪ All stories have yet to end ♪

16:31.240 --> 16:32.610
♪ Let me write for you ♪

16:32.670 --> 16:36.500
♪ An old CD will witness
our ever-ending dreams ♪

16:36.610 --> 16:39.660
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

16:39.750 --> 16:42.560
♪ In which everyone has fun till the end ♪

16:42.690 --> 16:46.320
♪ Joy and sorrow are woven together ♪

16:44.290 --> 16:45.820
[Class 9, Grade 11]

16:46.530 --> 16:50.180
♪ Every experience will bring me closer ♪

16:50.370 --> 16:50.970
♪ To myself ♪

16:57.600 --> 16:58.360
Tong Xiaole,

16:58.960 --> 16:59.870
you are really something.

16:59.870 --> 17:01.750
Your predictions about the exam
were spot on.

17:01.750 --> 17:04.349
I finally passed one exam,
with the score of 91.

17:04.960 --> 17:05.829
A breakthrough, finally!

17:05.829 --> 17:07.240
You've been secretly tutoring her?

17:07.240 --> 17:08.510
I want to join, Xiaole.

17:09.069 --> 17:10.069
What's with you?

17:10.069 --> 17:11.510
Why didn't you count me in
on that good thing?

17:11.510 --> 17:13.400
Do you not consider me as a close friend?

17:13.400 --> 17:14.530
I'd like to join too.

17:15.720 --> 17:17.920
No, no, absolutely not. No way.

17:18.000 --> 17:19.440
Now, what does that mean?

17:19.510 --> 17:21.829
You want all of us to cut ties with you?

17:22.000 --> 17:24.270
You must help us.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.750
Or I'll tell the entire class

17:26.750 --> 17:29.400
that Yi Lan got good grades
because you tutored her.

17:29.400 --> 17:31.160
I'll have everyone come to you for help.

17:31.160 --> 17:31.680
Ditto.

17:31.920 --> 17:32.640
Ditto.

17:37.030 --> 17:38.160
About this formula,

17:39.310 --> 17:40.720
I've basically explained everything.

17:40.720 --> 17:42.000
Is everyone clear on this?

17:42.000 --> 17:43.270
Yes.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.070
Yes.

17:44.790 --> 17:46.850
Math is different from liberal arts.

17:47.110 --> 17:48.240
You have to understand

17:48.240 --> 17:49.680
the formula
instead of memorizing it by rote

17:49.680 --> 17:50.920
or applying it mechanically.

17:50.920 --> 17:52.000
Just like Mr. Bu says,

17:52.000 --> 17:54.240
there's more than one solution
to a math problem.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.500
Flexibility is a must.

17:57.240 --> 17:57.680
Yi Lan.

17:58.750 --> 18:00.270
Repeat my explanation.

18:03.310 --> 18:05.750
Well, I... got the gist.

18:06.070 --> 18:06.550
But...

18:06.680 --> 18:07.510
Tong Xiaole!

18:08.400 --> 18:09.260
Zhao Zhenghao.

18:10.880 --> 18:11.810
What do you want?

18:16.940 --> 18:18.570
[Aoki High School Grade 11 Final Exam]

18:17.400 --> 18:18.550
Thirteen points?

18:21.160 --> 18:22.750
You must've written the answers
with all your heart,

18:22.750 --> 18:24.880
because even random scribbling
could've gotten you a higher score.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.480
This is too low a score.

18:30.030 --> 18:31.350
I'm an art student.

18:31.830 --> 18:34.090
My worth isn't measured by grades alone.

18:34.110 --> 18:35.880
I am very talented in art.

18:37.680 --> 18:39.140
What are you trying to say?

18:41.030 --> 18:43.090
I've observed you all for a long time.

18:45.030 --> 18:45.760
Tong Xiaole.

18:47.400 --> 18:49.000
Let me join the group, will you?

18:49.000 --> 18:51.000
I can be an assistant monitor to you.

18:51.720 --> 18:52.720
Stay away from me.

18:54.790 --> 18:55.550
Tong Xiaole!

18:56.750 --> 18:57.550
Let go of me!

18:57.550 --> 18:58.510
My mom said

18:58.720 --> 18:59.920
if I failed another exam,

18:59.920 --> 19:01.240
she'd stop giving me my allowance.

19:01.240 --> 19:03.160
Zhao Zhenghao, how is that relevant to me?

19:03.160 --> 19:04.270
It's not about money.

19:04.270 --> 19:05.240
Stay away from me!

19:05.240 --> 19:06.000
It's about my dignity.

19:06.000 --> 19:06.880
I refuse!

19:06.880 --> 19:07.680
I can't lose my dignity!

19:07.680 --> 19:09.440
Tong Xiaole, please, I beg you.

19:12.310 --> 19:13.070
Tong Xiaole.

19:22.200 --> 19:23.600
Come on, have some fruit.

19:26.770 --> 19:29.180
[Study Plan by Mr. Tong]

19:28.480 --> 19:29.140
Completed.

19:37.030 --> 19:38.490
It's time to watch dramas.

19:39.350 --> 19:40.080
Give it to me.

19:41.030 --> 19:43.490
Since we're all here to study
on the weekend,

19:43.510 --> 19:45.040
we should follow the rules.

19:45.640 --> 19:46.310
Got it?

19:49.310 --> 19:50.240
Stop reading it.

19:52.200 --> 19:54.000
I haven't finished the first...

19:56.680 --> 19:58.080
I've done all the papers.

20:01.070 --> 20:01.680
Xiaole,

20:01.960 --> 20:02.720
something

20:02.720 --> 20:04.050
doesn't seem fair to me.

20:04.480 --> 20:05.080
What is it?

20:05.240 --> 20:06.240
Look at your home.

20:07.590 --> 20:09.680
So much stuff exclusive to Yi Lan.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.960
I'm your brother from another mother.

20:11.960 --> 20:13.160
I want the same treatment.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.790
As you said, it's all exclusive to me.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.200
So only I can enjoy it.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.590
You're not getting anything.

20:17.590 --> 20:18.650
Double standards.

20:18.880 --> 20:20.440
I don't care. My brain is a mess now.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.310
I need a break.

20:21.550 --> 20:22.400
So do I.

20:22.750 --> 20:24.270
We've barely started.

20:24.480 --> 20:25.750
Every minute counts.

20:26.510 --> 20:27.440
Let's continue.

20:56.000 --> 20:56.400
Who...

20:56.720 --> 20:57.720
Who are you trying to scare

20:57.720 --> 20:58.880
with that stupid face of yours?

20:58.880 --> 21:00.510
I don't have a stupid face.
But you do have a stupid brain!

21:00.510 --> 21:02.240
Who are you calling stupid?

21:02.240 --> 21:04.160
You can solve a few math problems.
So what?

21:04.160 --> 21:05.310
Gentlemen use words, and not fists.

21:05.310 --> 21:06.750
Don't push me any further!

21:06.750 --> 21:08.720
I'm not pushing you!

21:08.720 --> 21:09.790
Stop running!

21:09.790 --> 21:11.000
What are you doing?

21:12.920 --> 21:14.240
Don't do that!

21:14.240 --> 21:16.310
Let go of me!

21:18.170 --> 21:19.650
♪ I can see you once I open my eyes ♪

21:20.050 --> 21:21.720
♪ Silly me, can't help but gaze at you ♪

21:20.720 --> 21:22.000
Stop butting in!

21:22.180 --> 21:25.040
♪ Your love is like a pink cloud ♪

21:22.960 --> 21:24.000
Stay there, you!

21:26.000 --> 21:28.750
Stop running. Who has a stupid brain now?
Who?

21:26.060 --> 21:27.710
♪ Whenever you come near ♪

21:27.770 --> 21:29.850
♪ I lose myself in you ♪

21:30.760 --> 21:33.820
♪ The corners of my mouth turn up
simply at the thought of you ♪

21:34.600 --> 21:36.120
♪ My IQ goes to zero ♪

21:36.440 --> 21:37.980
♪ Calories are my only cure ♪

21:38.530 --> 21:41.690
♪ I want a cup of boba tea with sugar ♪

21:42.680 --> 21:44.260
♪ With you around ♪

21:44.400 --> 21:46.550
♪ I feel like an untethered wild horse ♪

21:47.200 --> 21:49.480
♪ Love is the reason for gaining weight ♪

21:50.560 --> 21:53.580
♪ Boba tea with sugar means I like you ♪

21:54.040 --> 21:55.490
♪ Warm palms ♪

21:56.040 --> 21:57.620
♪ The pleasant smell of love ♪

21:57.980 --> 22:00.130
♪ I sync my playlist with yours
in secret ♪

21:58.160 --> 21:59.030
Read carefully.

21:58.950 --> 22:00.160
[Final Exam]

21:59.200 --> 22:00.240
Good luck to you all.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.160
♪ Let our hearts beat in sync ♪

22:01.240 --> 22:02.510
♪ Let us breathe in sync ♪

22:03.140 --> 22:06.860
♪ I absolutely, totally,
and utterly adore you ♪

22:06.920 --> 22:07.840
♪ Boba tea with sugar ♪

22:08.260 --> 22:09.870
♪ My dream for each new day ♪

22:08.350 --> 22:11.610
[Final Exam]

22:10.260 --> 22:11.870
♪ Is to hold you ♪

22:12.290 --> 22:13.830
♪ And have fun, hee-hee ♪

22:14.350 --> 22:15.580
♪ Without doubt ♪

22:15.630 --> 22:16.360
♪ The boba ♪

22:16.410 --> 22:17.580
♪ And pudding in my tea ♪

22:17.640 --> 22:18.930
♪ Are all yours ♪

22:19.340 --> 22:22.080
♪ You are everything I want ♪

22:21.480 --> 22:24.720
Chen Fan, scored 100 points. Gosh.
It's a triple digit.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.510
For getting a triple digit
within such a short time,

22:26.510 --> 22:27.640
Chen Fan, you are...

22:28.000 --> 22:29.550
a real genius.

22:31.960 --> 22:32.960
Yi Lan,

22:33.200 --> 22:34.400
scored 105 points.

22:34.480 --> 22:36.960
It's my first time exceeding 100 points.
Great!

22:36.960 --> 22:38.790
Qiao Mengmeng, scored 125 points.

22:38.790 --> 22:41.640
A small effort has yielded a big return.

22:49.240 --> 22:51.030
Luo Ningzi, scored 145 points.

22:54.030 --> 22:56.000
Did you study even in your sleep?

22:57.000 --> 23:00.000
Actually, I think Xiaole's tutoring
was very helpful.

23:00.000 --> 23:02.730
All I did was grasp the concepts
and extrapolate.

23:06.510 --> 23:08.640
Zhao Zhenghao is here to make a report.

23:09.750 --> 23:10.720
In this exam,

23:11.200 --> 23:13.240
Zhao Zhenghao scored 91 points.

23:14.240 --> 23:16.200
Nice work, Mr. Zhao.

23:16.640 --> 23:17.720
Please be seated!

23:25.440 --> 23:28.270
As your tutor,
I'm very proud of

23:28.270 --> 23:30.200
everyone's recent achievements.

23:30.310 --> 23:32.510
Keep up the good work though, everyone.

23:34.640 --> 23:37.960
Tong Xiaole scored a high score
of 150 points.

23:38.480 --> 23:40.080
Do learn from him, all of you.

23:42.480 --> 23:43.240
This is...

23:43.720 --> 23:45.680
your last summer vacation at  high school.

23:45.680 --> 23:47.000
I hope each of you will keep

23:47.000 --> 23:48.730
studying during the holidays.

23:49.200 --> 23:52.440
Get prepared
for the college entrance exam.

23:57.200 --> 23:57.960
Mr. Chen,

23:58.200 --> 23:59.790
you have limitless potential.

23:59.790 --> 24:01.450
You must believe in yourself.

24:01.510 --> 24:02.750
All the effort you've put in

24:02.750 --> 24:05.080
will pay off in the college entrance exam.

24:05.240 --> 24:05.750
Yes!

24:06.920 --> 24:07.920
All rise!

24:09.960 --> 24:11.090
Thank you, Mr. Tong.

24:11.590 --> 24:13.990
-Thank you, Mr. Tong.
-Thank you, Mr. Tong.

24:14.960 --> 24:15.690
Well then...

24:16.400 --> 24:17.200
you're welcome.

24:17.200 --> 24:19.000
Sit or move around as you please.

24:19.000 --> 24:19.750
Xiaole,

24:20.720 --> 24:22.320
can I borrow your exam paper?

24:22.480 --> 24:22.920
Sure.

24:29.070 --> 24:29.960
Goodbye, Sir.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.240
Goodbye.

24:37.440 --> 24:38.920
How was my acting? I want comments now.

24:38.920 --> 24:40.240
Alright. Now that the outsider's gone,

24:40.240 --> 24:41.000
and Xiaole's done with the acting,

24:41.000 --> 24:42.240
let's talk about the real business.

24:42.240 --> 24:43.270
After a rough week,

24:43.270 --> 24:45.720
don't you want to reward yourselves
properly?

24:45.720 --> 24:46.270
Yes!

24:46.640 --> 24:49.000
How about we spend two days and a night

24:49.000 --> 24:50.240
at my family's mountain villa?

24:50.240 --> 24:51.240
Sounds great!

24:51.240 --> 24:52.480
Ning, come with us.

24:53.920 --> 24:56.240
I've signed up for specialized courses
and IELTS classes.

24:56.240 --> 24:57.680
I don't think I can make it this time.

24:57.680 --> 25:00.070
Then you won't have time
to practice the cello with me?

25:00.070 --> 25:00.480
Look,

25:00.750 --> 25:02.950
hire a tutor to train your skills first.

25:02.960 --> 25:04.820
I'm sure we can hang out sometime.

25:05.160 --> 25:06.160
Are you really not going?

25:06.160 --> 25:07.310
Are you really not going?

25:07.310 --> 25:08.310
Have loads of fun!

25:10.200 --> 25:11.160
Mr. Chen Fan!

25:11.480 --> 25:13.010
After all I've done for you,

25:13.160 --> 25:14.960
don't you owe me a proper praise?

25:16.240 --> 25:17.720
You are amazing.

25:18.310 --> 25:19.240
Impressive.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.770
-Very much so.
-Marvelous.

25:23.920 --> 25:24.920
In this final exam,

25:24.920 --> 25:26.480
Lan's scores improved

25:26.750 --> 25:27.680
quite a lot.

25:27.790 --> 25:28.880
Good job, Sister.

25:29.000 --> 25:30.030
Bravo.

25:31.240 --> 25:32.070
Let's celebrate.

25:32.070 --> 25:33.750
What's there to celebrate?

25:33.920 --> 25:35.240
It's not like I got first place.

25:35.240 --> 25:37.480
But you will get there one day,
Sister.

25:37.480 --> 25:39.000
That's right. Cheers.

25:39.000 --> 25:40.000
Cheers.

25:46.720 --> 25:48.400
That said, Lan, take my advice.

25:48.400 --> 25:50.400
Don't stay up late to study anymore.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.880
It's bad for your health.

25:51.880 --> 25:52.920
Okay. Got it.

25:53.270 --> 25:54.680
Nothing can be done without health.

25:54.680 --> 25:55.270
Yeah.

25:56.000 --> 25:56.400
Dad.

25:56.480 --> 25:56.740
Yes?

25:56.750 --> 25:58.070
I have a little request.

25:58.070 --> 25:58.270
What is it?

25:58.270 --> 25:59.510
I'd like to have a two-day trip

25:59.510 --> 26:01.680
with Xiaole and some other classmates
this weekend.

26:01.680 --> 26:02.140
Can I go?

26:03.000 --> 26:03.640
With Xiaole?

26:03.640 --> 26:04.160
Yes.

26:04.160 --> 26:04.790
You can go.

26:04.880 --> 26:05.210
Sure.

26:05.480 --> 26:07.030
But you must stay safe.

26:07.240 --> 26:07.510
Yes.

26:07.510 --> 26:08.040
Alright?

26:09.480 --> 26:11.080
Dad, I have one more request.

26:11.480 --> 26:13.440
Can't you say them all at once?

26:14.640 --> 26:15.170
Speak up.

26:17.440 --> 26:20.200
I'd like to attend
professional cello lessons.

26:20.480 --> 26:20.920
No.

26:26.310 --> 26:26.960
Lan,

26:29.480 --> 26:30.240
I hope

26:30.880 --> 26:32.610
you will get into a university.

26:32.960 --> 26:33.480
Well,

26:34.200 --> 26:34.960
not necessarily a great one.

26:34.960 --> 26:35.920
An ordinary one is fine.

26:35.920 --> 26:37.830
You keep saying that all the time.

26:38.030 --> 26:39.000
If my mom were still around,

26:39.000 --> 26:40.860
she would definitely support me.

26:41.350 --> 26:43.350
Dad, don't you bully my sister!

26:43.680 --> 26:45.080
Just eat. Don't chime in.

26:47.310 --> 26:48.160
Lan,

26:48.640 --> 26:49.310
can we put

26:49.720 --> 26:50.650
this discussion

26:51.240 --> 26:52.270
on hold?

26:53.310 --> 26:54.960
We'll talk later. Let's eat.

26:56.510 --> 26:57.310
Come on.

26:57.720 --> 26:59.320
Look at this, a gift from Mom.

27:00.550 --> 27:01.480
Guess what it is.

27:03.310 --> 27:04.200
I don't know.

27:04.480 --> 27:06.270
It's a cello. Care for a try?

27:06.480 --> 27:06.960
Sure.

27:07.070 --> 27:07.670
Come here.

27:07.790 --> 27:08.680
This is the bow.

27:09.480 --> 27:11.080
Hold it with your right hand.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.550
Just hold the bow

27:14.960 --> 27:16.310
like you're holding an egg.

27:16.310 --> 27:17.200
Put it here?

27:17.200 --> 27:18.130
Yes, right here.

27:18.830 --> 27:20.890
Now, draw the bow across the strings.

27:22.480 --> 27:23.440
Does it sound good?

27:23.440 --> 27:23.920
Yes.

27:23.960 --> 27:24.620
Great, huh?

27:26.000 --> 27:26.600
A big bite.

27:27.480 --> 27:30.200
You can write down your wishes
on the candy wrapper, Lan.

27:30.200 --> 27:34.240
I wish to celebrate my birthday tomorrow
with Mom.

27:34.480 --> 27:35.480
Birthday celebration, huh?

27:35.480 --> 27:35.790
Yeah.

27:35.790 --> 27:37.990
Of course. I'll always be there for you.

28:05.070 --> 28:05.510
Hmm.

28:06.510 --> 28:07.970
Your dream will come true.

28:12.270 --> 28:13.600
Are you feeling better?

28:15.640 --> 28:16.170
Let's go.

28:16.750 --> 28:17.270
No.

28:18.030 --> 28:20.090
I'd like to hang around here for a bit.

28:20.880 --> 28:21.480
Here?

28:24.030 --> 28:25.030
Then give me a smile.

28:25.030 --> 28:27.760
I'll consider whether to keep you company
or not.

28:30.000 --> 28:30.790
Watch this.

28:38.550 --> 28:39.240
Hold on!

28:42.670 --> 28:45.990
[Purple-spotted Tonguefish]

28:43.880 --> 28:45.030
Read these characters.

28:43.910 --> 28:46.810
♪ Dusk gently fell on the coastline ♪

28:46.680 --> 28:48.310
"Purple-spotted..."

28:47.570 --> 28:50.460
♪ The quietly passing breeze
gave the clouds a kiss ♪

28:49.240 --> 28:50.550
Then it's...

28:51.140 --> 28:54.470
♪ The revolving earth
was bathed in romantic colors ♪

28:51.680 --> 28:52.720
It's...

28:54.590 --> 28:57.490
♪ That was the moment I met you ♪

28:57.000 --> 28:58.720
Gunpowder loaded.

28:57.970 --> 29:00.790
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

28:59.880 --> 29:00.480
Three.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.000
Two.

29:01.000 --> 29:01.400
One.

29:01.400 --> 29:02.270
Launch!

29:01.630 --> 29:04.080
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

29:03.160 --> 29:04.200
What a long slide!

29:04.480 --> 29:06.240
It's so fun. Come down here now!

29:04.870 --> 29:08.040
♪ The vast galaxy is singing
tender songs ♪

29:06.270 --> 29:07.000
Here I come!

29:07.000 --> 29:08.160
Hurry!

29:08.510 --> 29:11.100
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

29:11.720 --> 29:12.510
One more slide.

29:11.810 --> 29:14.970
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

29:15.270 --> 29:19.620
♪ I want to see every romantic sky
with you ♪

29:16.210 --> 29:19.180
[REC]

29:19.480 --> 29:20.960
My butt!

29:20.110 --> 29:24.130
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

29:22.000 --> 29:23.460
Why are you still filming?

29:25.050 --> 29:28.370
♪ Stars surround you and smile at you ♪

29:26.070 --> 29:27.130
Where's my camera?

29:27.550 --> 29:28.720
Where did it go?

29:28.400 --> 29:31.540
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

29:28.880 --> 29:29.480
My cam...

29:29.960 --> 29:31.160
Stop filming me.

29:31.720 --> 29:33.110
Photographers never get in the frame!

29:31.770 --> 29:35.650
♪ The light in your eyes shines
like diamonds ♪

29:33.480 --> 29:34.440
Turn it off!

29:35.920 --> 29:36.880
This is annoying!

29:35.930 --> 29:38.850
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

29:38.880 --> 29:42.170
♪ The night breeze embraces you
while I run towards you ♪

29:42.070 --> 29:43.070
It's pretty!

29:42.200 --> 29:45.140
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

29:45.750 --> 29:49.540
♪ Let's build a castle in a dream ♪

29:49.860 --> 29:52.160
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

29:52.200 --> 29:55.880
Yi Lan will definitely become a cellist!

29:52.270 --> 29:55.310
♪ Let me find you ♪

29:56.200 --> 29:58.920
Yes, I will!

29:59.400 --> 30:01.750
Then what should Tong Xiaole do?

30:02.920 --> 30:05.160
Ask yourself!

30:19.350 --> 30:20.110
I'm back.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.480
You're back, Sister!

30:23.640 --> 30:24.480
Kiddo,

30:25.000 --> 30:26.160
did you behave at school today?

30:26.160 --> 30:27.160
Yes, I did!

30:27.160 --> 30:28.070
I doubt it.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.530
Then ask my teacher.

30:30.750 --> 30:31.550
Auntie.

30:33.200 --> 30:33.680
Hello.

30:37.960 --> 30:39.310
You were adorable.

30:39.960 --> 30:41.480
Am I not adorable now?

30:41.550 --> 30:43.640
Yes, you are. Pretty, too.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.420
Xiaole was also adorable.

30:50.240 --> 30:53.110
Why are there so many photos of Xiaole
in your album?

30:53.310 --> 30:55.110
I've known him since childhood.

30:56.720 --> 30:57.510
That's true.

31:00.550 --> 31:02.110
Your mother was gorgeous.

31:03.200 --> 31:05.270
Not only that, she was also amazing,

31:05.400 --> 31:08.030
as the principal player
of a major cello orchestra.

31:08.030 --> 31:09.890
She took me with her on every tour.

31:10.200 --> 31:11.640
Your mom was incredible.

31:12.070 --> 31:13.600
What did she see in your dad?

31:14.000 --> 31:16.000
I'm not suggesting that he's awful.

31:16.030 --> 31:19.550
But didn't you always complain
him being stingy and naggy?

31:20.110 --> 31:22.070
My dad is a considerate gentleman.

31:22.200 --> 31:24.460
He makes delicious food for us every day.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.210
What do you think of this dress?

31:34.240 --> 31:35.440
Replace it with this.

31:43.200 --> 31:43.800
That's it.

31:48.160 --> 31:49.560
This outfit and skirt...

31:50.070 --> 31:52.350
I'd like to wear these
to my idol's concert.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.270
Okay. I'll lend them to you.

31:53.270 --> 31:53.730
Thanks.

31:58.070 --> 31:59.400
Have some fruit, girls.

32:02.590 --> 32:04.440
Mengmeng, why not stay for dinner?

32:04.440 --> 32:05.640
No, thanks, Mrs. Yi.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.200
Alright.

32:06.200 --> 32:07.130
Thanks, Auntie.

32:09.480 --> 32:10.030
Eat up!

32:12.920 --> 32:14.000
How are things

32:14.920 --> 32:15.580
between you

32:15.880 --> 32:17.080
and your stepmother?

32:18.200 --> 32:18.750
Well...

32:19.880 --> 32:20.810
Generally fine.

32:21.720 --> 32:23.240
Do you still miss your mom?

32:23.480 --> 32:24.510
Of course I do!

32:25.640 --> 32:26.510
I thought so.

32:27.960 --> 32:29.480
Sometimes, I think

32:30.200 --> 32:31.730
if my mom were still around,

32:32.240 --> 32:34.000
she would definitely be my tutor

32:34.000 --> 32:36.530
and shape me into a great cellist
like she was.

32:37.270 --> 32:38.000
Wait.

32:38.510 --> 32:42.040
Your dad shouldn't be against
you practicing the cello, right?

32:42.440 --> 32:43.640
I don't get it either.

32:44.000 --> 32:45.130
Every time I mention

32:45.160 --> 32:45.790
the cello,

32:46.030 --> 32:47.760
he gets really stern and weird.

32:48.550 --> 32:49.480
Perhaps...

32:50.480 --> 32:52.810
me playing the cello
reminds him of my mom.

32:53.000 --> 32:53.790
Hmm.

32:55.480 --> 32:56.720
I miss my dad too.

32:57.310 --> 32:58.170
But as you know,

32:58.240 --> 32:59.920
my mom never agrees to let me see him,

32:59.920 --> 33:01.720
accusing him of being a scumbag.

33:02.270 --> 33:04.800
I definitely won't find a boyfriend
like him.

33:06.240 --> 33:08.240
I'm determined to be with someone

33:08.270 --> 33:11.200
who will treat me very, very well.

33:11.480 --> 33:12.720
I believe you'll find that guy.

33:12.720 --> 33:14.980
Don't forget that I'll keep you company.

33:18.480 --> 33:19.550
So beautiful!

33:26.640 --> 33:28.480
Xiaole, take photos of me instead!

33:28.480 --> 33:29.280
That's right!

33:42.200 --> 33:43.260
You all look great.

33:49.630 --> 33:52.850
[REC]

34:02.240 --> 34:03.880
Look, a goose!

34:05.440 --> 34:06.480
And it's black.

34:07.550 --> 34:08.510
So pretty.

34:10.630 --> 34:11.920
Shall we go take some photos?

34:11.920 --> 34:12.780
Sure, let's go.

34:12.800 --> 34:13.260
Xiaole!

34:13.480 --> 34:14.540
Give me the camera.

34:15.510 --> 34:16.670
Be careful. Don't drop it.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.469
Rest assured.

34:23.630 --> 34:24.830
It's beautiful here.

34:24.960 --> 34:26.760
Let me take a photo of you. Hurry!

34:27.070 --> 34:27.670
Next pose.

34:28.840 --> 34:29.170
Next.

34:29.480 --> 34:29.880
Next.

34:30.150 --> 34:30.480
Good.

34:31.030 --> 34:31.400
Good.

34:32.400 --> 34:32.800
Great.

34:32.840 --> 34:33.280
Next pose.

34:33.280 --> 34:33.510
Done.

34:33.510 --> 34:33.969
My turn!

34:52.800 --> 34:53.730
Anything wrong?

34:56.510 --> 34:57.590
Well...

34:57.880 --> 35:00.140
I'm just thinking about my mother again.

35:01.670 --> 35:03.320
She told me

35:04.480 --> 35:07.340
when I reached a certain level
at playing the cello,

35:07.630 --> 35:09.290
I could feel a flow in my heart.

35:10.920 --> 35:13.510
Actually, I've always been curious

35:15.070 --> 35:16.550
how that flow would feel

35:18.000 --> 35:19.320
when I play the cello.

35:32.480 --> 35:34.320
You're terrible at it.

35:34.670 --> 35:38.510
Don't play the cello again.

35:44.960 --> 35:46.360
What are you laughing at?

35:48.110 --> 35:49.280
I don't know

35:49.550 --> 35:52.070
what the flow you're talking about
feels like.

35:52.070 --> 35:54.150
But I did feel tears running down my face

35:54.150 --> 35:56.000
the first time I heard you play the cello.

35:56.000 --> 35:57.860
Can't you just drop that subject?

35:58.000 --> 35:59.440
I remember you played the cello

35:59.440 --> 36:01.100
like you were sawing firwood.

36:02.670 --> 36:04.440
You're asking for a beating!

36:05.360 --> 36:07.550
Mengmeng, Chen Fan, come here!

36:07.550 --> 36:09.150
Someone's getting annoying again!

36:09.150 --> 36:10.070
We're coming!

36:11.510 --> 36:12.310
Come here now!

36:16.280 --> 36:17.030
Look.

36:17.030 --> 36:17.800
Take a look.

36:20.590 --> 36:21.840
Such lovely photos.

36:23.630 --> 36:24.960
Take a group photo of us,

36:25.920 --> 36:27.120
including yourself.

36:34.840 --> 36:35.840
Chen Fan,

36:36.000 --> 36:38.550
how much longer
until we get to your house?

36:40.400 --> 36:42.670
Very soon.

36:44.510 --> 36:49.910
[I hope Dad will stop objecting
to me learning the cello]
[It will come true]
